<title>POLAND: Polish bourse delays order-balancing session.</title>
<headline>Polish bourse delays order-balancing session.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Warsaw Stock Exchange's order-balancing session will be delayed on Tuesday, starting at 1000 GMT and ending at 1035, the bourse said in a statement.</p>
<p>It gave no other details.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
